LMA old LTX 0.9.8 T5 encoder research component

This standalone, unregistered component uses llama.cpp under the MIT license.
Pinned upstream source and the original license are recorded in
third_party/ltx098-text-source-lock.json and licenses/llama-MIT.txt.

No learned weights, tokenizer vocabulary, SentencePiece model, or normalization
character map is included here or added to the APK. Model assets remain external
and require an explicit developer download or a future explicit user selection.
The city96 quantized T5 encoder and Google reference tokenizer are Apache-2.0
model assets with separate pinned provenance. This component does not establish
an operational video pipeline, App route, or physical Android compatibility.
